## COMPONENT LIBRARY

Skeleton do documento:

```
.bg-grid (fixed, z-index 0)  →  .container (max-width 1600px)
  └ .header (.logo-icon + título + .header-meta: .version, .update-pill, .date)
  └ .filters (.filter-select simples + .filter-multi custom)   [opcional]
  └ .kpi-grid (auto-fit minmax(170px,1fr))  →  .kpi-card.<success|danger|warning|info|muted>
  └ .tab-nav (.tab-btn.active = var(--accent))  →  .tab-content.active
       └ .charts-grid (2-col, .chart-card.full = span all)  →  .chart-card > .chart-header + .chart-container[.tall|.short]
       └ table.dt (th sortável, hover-highlight, num em mono, .ok/.warn/.bad)
  └ .footnote
```

Componentes disponíveis: header, KPI cards (variantes de token semântico +
`.muted`), tabs, chart cards, tabela de dados sortável (`table.dt`), section
header + pills, footnote, filters bar + custom multi-select, badges/pills.

> **Hover/entry motion:** governado pela lei sem-deslocamento (seção
> ANIMATIONS abaixo) — cards nunca transladam; hover = fade de
> background/border.

